  "description": "In the waning age of magic there lived \"Tethys\", the royal court sorcerer of the Belga Kingdom, and \"Dima\", a skilled wand craftsman.\n\nWhile Dima never hid his affection, Tethys always met it with a teasing smile.\n\nOne day, a prodigiously powerful young sorcerer named \"Enya\" appeared in the kingdom. Fate would one day bind \"Tethys\" to \"Enya\"—through a wand crafted by \"Dima\"’s own hands.\n\nThis is the story of three, set in the Velga Kingdom, built upon the cliffs where the waves crash below.\n\n**Original Manhwa:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1518000663), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13606250) \n\n**Official English:**  \nGumroad,\nPayhip",
